PayReserved_Budgets_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when a call into Budgets is already running
│   └── it should revert with ReentrantCall
├── when the caller is not the Agreements contract
│   └── it should revert with OnlyAgreements
└── when the caller is the Agreements contract
    ├── when the budget does not exist
    │   └── it should revert with UnknownBudget
    └── when the budget exists
        ├── it should pay through the payout role with kind 4
        ├── it should not change ownSpent or spent
        ├── given the budget is closed
        │   └── it should still pay
        ├── when Roles or the token refuses the payout
        │   └── it should revert whole
        ├── when the token re-enters Budgets during the payout
        │   └── it should revert the inner call with ReentrantCall
        ├── it should return the payment id
        └── it should emit ReservedPaid
